== Details ===================

Blade:
[ground]
 axis = (pointer-player) projection on platform tangent
 Movement:
	ADSR movement (AR, DS -> null). State transition isn't allowed until "controll back" (E:ctrlB) or A phase end (E:aEnd). Model configures when E:ctrlB (<= time of attack end)
 Heartbox:
 	irregular pentagon (rectangle + triangle, like home + roof). For example (0,1) (1, 1) (3, 0) (1, -1) (0, -1). Center of this figure is "bottom" of rectangle
	looks along axis. It doesn't appear immediate. Model configures time (it could be during A or R phases). Time of destoying hearbox also configured (<= time of attack end)
 Edge cases:
	platform -> [air]	continue the same it would on platform
	platform -> platfrom2	continue the same it would on platofrm, but along platform2 (heartbox too)
[air]
 axis = (pointer-player)
 Movement:
	the same as [ground]
 Heartbox:
 	the same as [ground]
 Edge cases:
	[air] -> platform	continue the same it would in air, but along platform (heartbox too)


Fire:
[+]
 axis = (pointer-player)
 Movement:
	the same as Blade movement but along -axis 
 Heartbox:
 	one frame rectangle along axis. Parry rule the same they was
 Edge cases:
 	the same as Blade movement for [ground] and [air]


DownA:
 Movement:
 	Vertically ADSR movement (AS, DS -> null). At S phase moves on "max speed". Horizontally ADSR (R, ADS -> null)
 Heartbox:
 	the same as Blade heartbox but looks along velocity (so when Horizontal speed would be 0, looks vertical down)

